From: Pixel AOSP maintainers <pixel-aosp@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:31:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fsgen: support the public Malibu FBPK adapter

Prefer the checked-in adevtool FBPK extractor when Google's private platform
tool is absent, retain the private path as a compatible fallback, and fail
analysis when neither path exists. Make the bootloader-carrier build identity
files normal inputs so incremental builds cannot retain stale AVB descriptors.
Pin both path selection and the carrier salt/size command in focused tests.

This is a project-authored android-17.0.0_r1 compatibility fix.
License: Apache-2.0 (platform/build/soong)
